<symbol type="16" id="60" code="307" name="Uncrossable marsh"><description>A marsh which is uncrossable or which may constitute a danger to the competitor. The feature shall not be crossed.
At least two blue lines shall be clearly visible.
Minimum width: 2 lines.</description><combined_symbol parts="2"><part symbol="61"/><part symbol="62"/></combined_symbol></symbol>
